	"data": "UIUC — VR@Illinois, NCSA & CS\n\nPart of [[projects/grad-school-options|Grad School Options]] research.\n\nOverview\n\nThe University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign combines a world-class CS program — consistently ranked in the top 5 nationally — with unique resources in NCSA (National Center for Supercomputing Applications) and the VR@Illinois cross-campus initiative. NCSA operates CAVE2 and advanced visualization facilities that few universities can match. The MS thesis track is often funded, making…",
